# The curandera of the candle lane (the talk and quests spec, section 6;
# docs/systems/dialogue.md): she stands at the votive ledges on the far wall,
# east of the librarian's shop. She reads the stranger, and asks him for a book
# only the librarian next door has; given it, she pays in copal. A curandera by
# trade (types/curandera.dialogue): she offers its limpia and copal too, and
# her limpia is her own.
# "Curandera" before a line's colon is the name shown in the box, a working
# name: change it here and in name: together.
# Every text is the user's to write; each beat's intent: says what it must do.

== character curandera
name: Curandera
type: curandera
body: duelist
colour: copal
voice: female
intent: the curandera of the candle lane: she keeps the votives by the chapel and sees more than she says; she wants a book back from the librarian

== beat open_first
when: not(met)
intent: the first meeting: she reads him before he speaks, something true about him he has not said; then waits for him to ask
Curandera [flare]: <<She reads the stranger before he has said a word.>>
Sense obsidian: <<The obsidian knows she is looking at it.>>
> <<Ask what she wants of you.>> -> asks
> <<Leave.>> -> end

== beat open_has_book
when: has(the_book), not(gave(the_book))
intent: he comes back carrying the book: she knows it is on him before he shows it
Curandera [flare]: <<She knows the book is on him before he shows it.>>
> [if has(the_book)] <<Hand her the book.>> -> gives_bundle
> [if has(the_book)] <<Tell her you do not have it.>> -> lie_no_book
> <<Leave.>> -> end

== beat open_after
when: gave(the_book)
intent: after the quest: she meets him as someone who kept his word; easier with him now, not warm
Curandera [calm]: <<She greets him as someone who kept his word.>>
> <<Leave.>> -> end

== beat open
intent: a revisit before the book is brought: she looks up from her candles; if she has asked, she waits to hear of it
Curandera: <<She looks up from her candles.>>
Sense obsidian [if said(asked_book)]: <<The candle flames lean toward the shop next door.>>
> [if not(said(asked_book))] <<Ask what she wants of you.>> -> asks
> [if said(asked_book)] <<Ask her again about the book.>> -> asks
> <<Leave.>> -> end

== beat asks
do: set(asked_book), goal(bring_book)
intent: she asks him to bring her a book the librarian next door keeps; she says which book, not why she wants it
Curandera: <<She asks him to bring her a book the librarian keeps, and says which.>>
> <<Say you will bring it.>> -> end

== beat limpia
intent: her own limpia, unlike any other curandera's: what she does that no other does, and what she finds in him that frightens her a little
Curandera [flare]: <<Her own cleansing, unlike any other curandera's.>>
[pause 1.5]
Curandera [gutter]: <<What she found in him, and that it frightens her a little.>>
-> end

== beat gives_bundle
do: take(the_book), give(copal_bundle), note(curandera_bundle)
intent: he hands her the book; she takes it like something stolen back, and presses a bundle of her own copal into his hand: what it is for
Curandera [nod]: <<She takes the book and presses a bundle of her copal into his hand.>>
-> end

== beat lie_no_book
do: mood(-1)
intent: he says he does not have it, and she can see it on him; her flame gutters; hurt more than angry
Curandera [gutter]: <<She knows he is lying, and lets him see that she knows.>>
> [if has(the_book)] <<Give it to her after all.>> -> gives_bundle
> <<Leave.>> -> end

== goal bring_book
kind: side
shows: said(asked_book)
done: gave(the_book)
intent: the side goal on the letter: bring the curandera the book from the librarian's shop
text: <<Bring the curandera the book from the librarian's shop.>>

== item copal_bundle
name: <<a bundle of the curandera's copal>>
look: bundle
intent: copal resin wrapped in a leaf and tied with thread: hers, given for the book, or any curandera's, bought

== note curandera_bundle
intent: his pencil note after she gave him the copal: what it is for, as he would jot it down
text: <<The curandera's copal, and what it is for.>>
